# node X25519 ECDH implementation. Forwards to the linked x25519 runtime shim (Web Crypto X25519). make-key-pair-bytes returns the 32-byte private key and 32-byte public key concatenated (64 raw bytes); the shared secret is raw bytes. Internal: reached only through the public key-agreement API.

dock load
  load <global:x25519>, name x25519

task make-key-pair-bytes
  note async
  like bytes
  send back
    call x25519/make-key-pair

task compute-shared-secret
  note async
  take private-key, like bytes
  take public-key, like bytes
  like bytes
  send back
    call x25519/shared-secret
      read private-key
      read public-key
